      "message": "I\u0027m considering changing this boot parameter into a tristate `redirect_cma\u003dnever | restricted | always` to allow for resroring the upstream functionality too because another vendor is asking for an option to use upstream logic.\n\n`redirect_cma\u003dnever` will work the way upstream works today;\n`redirect_cma\u003drestricted` will work the same as `restrict_cma_redirect\u003dtrue`;\n`redirect_cma\u003dalways` will work as `restrict_cma_redirect\u003dfalse`;\n\nDefault will be `redirect_cma\u003dalways` to keep current functionality. Does that work for you?",
